servation Road with a bike or scooter, check posted conditions, and pair the pump track with the park’s courts or exercise area.","short_summary":"A wheeled-sports stop backed by courts, fitness space, and a playground.","evidence_claim":"The City of Marina documents a professionally designed pump track plus basketball, pickleball, exercise, playground, dog-park, gazebo, and cornhole amenities.","source_url":"https://www.cityofmarina.org/341/Glorya-Jean-Tate","source_title":"Glorya Jean Tate Park & Pump Track","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City park rules prohibit presence from one hour after sunset until sunrise without prior authorization; the city may close facilities for maintenance.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"marina-branch-library","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Marina Branch Library","title":"Settle Into a Study Room","subtitle":"On Seaside Circle near Reservation Road","notes":"Turn from Reservation Road onto Seaside Circle, ask about a study room, and use the public computers or free Wi-Fi for a focused work session.","short_summary":"A county library stop with study rooms, technology, and student support.","evidence_claim":"Monterey County lists two study rooms, public computers, free wireless internet, and a Tuesday-through-Thursday Student Support Center at this branch.","source_url":"https://www.countyofmonterey.gov/government/departments-i-z/library/locations/marina-branch?NavID=3916","source_title":"Marina Branch","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open Tuesday 11 a.m.–7 p.m., Wednesday 11 a.m.–7 p.m., Thursday 10 a.m.–6 p.m., and Friday–Saturday 10 a.m.–5 p.m.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rei-marina","subject_type":"street_or_district"